ovn-kubernetes #6735 (merge a78f1093 in github.com/ovn-kubernetes/ovn-kubernetes),
go-controller/ only: the kubelet-cgroup-path setting, and UDN host isolation
degrading instead of failing ovnkube-node startup. OpenShift's ovn-kubernetes
carries it from release-5.1. src/ovn/build-ovnkube.sh applies it.

